<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="yes"?>
<roster id="asxic4q" name="mon-001-all-units" battleScribeVersion="2.03" generatedBy="https://newrecruit.eu" gameSystemId="e51d-b1a3-75fc-dc3g" gameSystemName="Age of Sigmar 4.0" gameSystemRevision="98" xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/rosterSchema"><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="6630" /></costs><costLimits><costLimit name="pts" typeId="points" value="0" /></costLimits><forces><force id="b2ajiql" name="✦ General's Handbook 2026-27" entryId="0151-9c5b-2f1e-32d4" catalogueId="5079-92b5-4879-69f8" catalogueRevision="48" catalogueName="Maggotkin of Nurgle"><selections><selection id="q6ixzo" name="Allow Legends" entryId="7e59-2237-4890-a80a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" name="Configuration" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="qc0dude" name="Battle Traits: Maggotkin of Nurgle" entryId="866c-d78d-2324-2316::27d6-7ce0-8f51-c075" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7709-9243-a8b5-ff1e" name="Desperate Remedies" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If an ability would heal or return slain models to a **^^Diseased^^** enemy unit, that ability does not heal any damage points or return any slain models to it. Instead, it no longer has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="81e8-e2f8-46ab-7d2" name="Wracked with Disease" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick each **^^Diseased^^** enemy unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Inflict D3 mortal damage on each target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="b933-7caa-30a0-12e8" name="Blessed By the Plaguefather" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects: 
***Infect:*** Pick an enemy unit within 7&quot; of any friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgles^^** unit to be the target. You cannot pick a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature.
• If the target is in combat with any **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** units, it has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.
• If the target is not in combat with any **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** units, roll a dice. On a 4+, the target has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.
***Spread:*** Pick a **^^Diseased^^** enemy unit to be the target. Each other enemy unit within the target's combat range, excluding **^^Manifestations^^** and terrain features, has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.
***Mutate:*** If all enemy units on the battlefield, excluding **^^Manifestations^^** and terrain features, have the **^^Diseased^^** keyword, inflict 1 mortal damage on each of them.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="7c3b-0ed3-037f-f87f" name="Burst Pustules" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time a **^^Diseased^^** enemy unit is destroyed, before the last model in the unit is removed from play, roll a dice. On a 3+, pick another enemy unit within 9&quot; of that model to be the target. You cannot pick a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature. The target has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="5267-a951-8259-91ec" name="Blighted Regrowth" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">You can use this ability if there are no friendly **Feculent Gnarlmaws** on the battlefield.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up a **Feculent Gnarlmaw** on the battlefield wholly within 12&quot; of an objective you control and more than 3&quot; from all enemy units, objectives, and other terrain features.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="6fac-5588-9499-c202" name="Ceaseless Infectors" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit that was in combat with a friendly **^^Rotbringers^^** unit that was destroyed this turn to be the target. You cannot pick a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, the target has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="3360-1158-e879-9606" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" name="Reference" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="c5nsa5s" name="Battle Formation" entryId="7da2-e40b-2bb3-69b2" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="qhqoy26" name="Battle Formation" entryId="7da2-e40b-2bb3-69b2" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="c88rokj" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="qnygi7" name="Battle Tactic Cards" entryId="1668-6989-2470-5e10" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="cb69d3" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="62ab-4016-1c63-32fd" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="qtl3d1" name="Manifestation Lore" entryId="62ab-4016-1c63-32fd" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="cei4mo8" name="Prayer Lore" entryId="08a0-099a-8557-8fa4" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="cfv3k09" name="Lore of Virulence" entryId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::a977-b5da-6f01-56bc" entryGroupId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::dd99-051a-be7c-5635" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Prayer Lores"><selections><selection id="cgv89j9" name="Bloated with Sickness" entryId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::a034-d984-8d81-6e20" entryGroupId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::242a-210c-e7cd-fae0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Virulence"><profiles><profile id="66fa-209c-4c5b-3091" name="Bloated with Sickness" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly non-**^^Monster Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of the chanter to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Until the start of your next turn, ignore the first damage point that would be allocated to the target in each phase, If the chanting roll was 10+, you can pick another eligible unit to be a second target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="cg1kn1" name="Favoured Poxes" entryId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::c6d5-3d5c-af97-d068" entryGroupId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::242a-210c-e7cd-fae0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Virulence"><profiles><profile id="d3cc-7d13-9877-5a3b" name="Favoured Poxes" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of the chanter to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Until the start of your next turn, subtract 2 from charge rolls for the target, If the chanting roll was 10+, subtract 1 from the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for the target, to a minimum of 1, instead.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="cg1qn5r" name="Gift of Disease" entryId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::9075-6fd4-b752-adfc" entryGroupId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::242a-210c-e7cd-fae0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Virulence"><profiles><profile id="b513-30b2-8c37-7cdd" name="Gift of Disease" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Priest^^** to chant this prayer, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Until the start of your next turn, subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks made by enemy units while they are in combat with the chanter. In addition, if the chanting roll was 10+, each enemy unit in combat with the chanter, excluding **^^Manifestations^^** and terrain features, has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="r74s9hz" name="Prayer Lore" entryId="08a0-099a-8557-8fa4" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="r8m4eh" name="Lore of Virulence" entryId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::a977-b5da-6f01-56bc" entryGroupId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::dd99-051a-be7c-5635" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Prayer Lores"><selections><selection id="r9zjpkm" name="Bloated with Sickness" entryId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::a034-d984-8d81-6e20" entryGroupId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::242a-210c-e7cd-fae0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Virulence"><profiles><profile id="66fa-209c-4c5b-3091" name="Bloated with Sickness" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible friendly non-**^^Monster Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of the chanter to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Until the start of your next turn, ignore the first damage point that would be allocated to the target in each phase, If the chanting roll was 10+, you can pick another eligible unit to be a second target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="r9575k" name="Favoured Poxes" entryId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::c6d5-3d5c-af97-d068" entryGroupId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::242a-210c-e7cd-fae0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Virulence"><profiles><profile id="d3cc-7d13-9877-5a3b" name="Favoured Poxes" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Priest^^** to chant this prayer, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of the chanter to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Until the start of your next turn, subtract 2 from charge rolls for the target, If the chanting roll was 10+, subtract 1 from the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for the target, to a minimum of 1, instead.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="r9dj0ri" name="Gift of Disease" entryId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::9075-6fd4-b752-adfc" entryGroupId="3127-ac44-ad4c-3dc2::27fc-eb5c-f9a0-26ef::242a-210c-e7cd-fae0" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Virulence"><profiles><profile id="b513-30b2-8c37-7cdd" name="Gift of Disease" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Priest^^** to chant this prayer, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Until the start of your next turn, subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks made by enemy units while they are in combat with the chanter. In addition, if the chanting roll was 10+, each enemy unit in combat with the chanter, excluding **^^Manifestations^^** and terrain features, has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="ckr229ij" name="Spell Lore" entryId="1f74-31b8-a2f9-ad68" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="clsup3j" name="Lore of Malignance" entryId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::8f07-178f-d381-b3d2" entryGroupId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::d695-7b4a-fb25-7084" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="cmnf1b9" name="Cloying Quagmire" entryId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::6da2-4ffc-713a-5091" entryGroupId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::5569-e052-c56c-ba3a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Malignance"><profiles><profile id="2f43-ba59-527-8a44" name="Cloying Quagmire" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
• Halve the target's Move characteristic.
• If the target's Save characteristic is 3+ or better, subtract 1 from run rolls and charge rolls for the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="cmvlpek" name="Crippling Despair" entryId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::9b91-adc9-cffd-a9df" entryGroupId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::5569-e052-c56c-ba3a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Malignance"><profiles><profile id="211-c3e1-6ad2-24c7" name="Crippling Despair" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target cannot use commands for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="cmkmyve" name="Fleshy Abundance" entryId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::7697-ad69-725e-bbed" entryGroupId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::5569-e052-c56c-ba3a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Malignance"><profiles><profile id="c52d-4e54-9d5e-1f3b" name="Fleshy Abundance" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Pick 1 of the following effects:
• **Heal (D3)** the target.
• Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks that target that friendly unit until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="rhonx2w" name="Spell Lore" entryId="1f74-31b8-a2f9-ad68" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><selections><selection id="rhadhcg" name="Lore of Malignance" entryId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::8f07-178f-d381-b3d2" entryGroupId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::d695-7b4a-fb25-7084" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Spell Lores"><selections><selection id="ridvz8r" name="Cloying Quagmire" entryId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::6da2-4ffc-713a-5091" entryGroupId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::5569-e052-c56c-ba3a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Malignance"><profiles><profile id="2f43-ba59-527-8a44" name="Cloying Quagmire" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn:
• Halve the target's Move characteristic.
• If the target's Save characteristic is 3+ or better, subtract 1 from run rolls and charge rolls for the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ritip6" name="Crippling Despair" entryId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::9b91-adc9-cffd-a9df" entryGroupId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::5569-e052-c56c-ba3a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Malignance"><profiles><profile id="211-c3e1-6ad2-24c7" name="Crippling Despair" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target cannot use commands for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rizy6y" name="Fleshy Abundance" entryId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::7697-ad69-725e-bbed" entryGroupId="9fae-f239-19d8-72d8::4948-a6c5-63be-43ae::5569-e052-c56c-ba3a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Lore of Malignance"><profiles><profile id="c52d-4e54-9d5e-1f3b" name="Fleshy Abundance" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Wizard^^** to cast this spell, pick a visible friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of them to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Pick 1 of the following effects:
• **Heal (D3)** the target.
• Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks that target that friendly unit until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**, **^^Unlimited^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><categories><category id="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" name="Army Composition" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="co881cs" name="Feculent Gnarlmaw" entryId="1918-e7dc-8772-38ec::f4aa-9ef3-286-f6db" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="81e2-8dfb-2477-8cd0" name="Feculent Gnarlmaw" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Unstable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="9af6-1f5b-6927-f926" name="Feculent Gnarlmaw" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b317-f6d-70d1-8ea6" name="Rot-Blossom" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Friendly **^^Rotbringers^^** units have **^^Ward (5+)^^** while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this terrain feature.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c4c1-e2d7-d20e-e01e" name="Tendrils of Corruption" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the phase, this terrain feature has a Move characteristic of 3&quot; and can immediately move 3&quot;. It cannot move through or end that move within the combat ranges of enemy units and it cannot end that move on an objective or another terrain feature.
**Designer's Note:** *This terrain feature cannot use* **^^Move^^**, **^^Run^^***,* **^^Retreat^^** *or* **^^Charge^^** *abilities.*</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Grey</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="0c1d-0610-8d71-7842" name="Riddled With Disease" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Daemon^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this terrain feature uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 1 additional rally roll of D6. If that unit is a non-**^^Hero^^** unit, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6 instead.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="cpek4r" name="Maggot-infested Mouth" entryId="1918-e7dc-8772-38ec::21b9-3425-9744-b76e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5c7-18b-3711-f81d" name="Maggot-infested Mouth" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections><categories><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="rqkcp5w" name="Feculent Gnarlmaw" entryId="1918-e7dc-8772-38ec::f4aa-9ef3-286-f6db" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><rules><rule id="81e2-8dfb-2477-8cd0" name="Feculent Gnarlmaw" hidden="false"><description>**The following universal terrain abilities apply to this terrain feature (Terrain, 1.2):
Cover, Unstable**</description></rule></rules><profiles><profile id="9af6-1f5b-6927-f926" name="Feculent Gnarlmaw" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b317-f6d-70d1-8ea6" name="Rot-Blossom" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Friendly **^^Rotbringers^^** units have **^^Ward (5+)^^** while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this terrain feature.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c4c1-e2d7-d20e-e01e" name="Tendrils of Corruption" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For the rest of the phase, this terrain feature has a Move characteristic of 3&quot; and can immediately move 3&quot;. It cannot move through or end that move within the combat ranges of enemy units and it cannot end that move on an objective or another terrain feature.
**Designer's Note:** *This terrain feature cannot use* **^^Move^^**, **^^Run^^***,* **^^Retreat^^** *or* **^^Charge^^** *abilities.*</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Grey</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="0c1d-0610-8d71-7842" name="Riddled With Disease" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Daemon^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this terrain feature uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 1 additional rally roll of D6. If that unit is a non-**^^Hero^^** unit, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6 instead.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="rqgvej" name="Maggot-infested Mouth" entryId="1918-e7dc-8772-38ec::21b9-3425-9744-b76e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5c7-18b-3711-f81d" name="Maggot-infested Mouth" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections><categories><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" name="FACTION TERRAIN" primary="true" /></categories></selection></selections><costs><cost name="Force Category - GHB" typeId="de92-2099-fbf7-a156" value="1" /></costs><categories><category name="Configuration" id="3gw482" primary="false" entryId="676-2b78-7bbf-ba9c" /><category name="Reference" id="3h9vwo" primary="false" entryId="3360-1158-e879-9606" /><category name="Army Composition" id="b5dxqca" primary="false" entryId="ac97-b27c-7e35-7ab9" /><category name="FACTION TERRAIN" id="b59p7u" primary="false" entryId="cdd6-ffa1-9b32-4cb8" /><category name="Illegal Units" id="pn46x0g" primary="false" entryId="(Illegal Units)" /></categories><forces><force id="21ofxet" name="Auxillary Units" entryId="6084-3baa-f00b-ac0a::8732-47c4-9f1c-e71e" catalogueId="5079-92b5-4879-69f8" catalogueRevision="48" catalogueName="Maggotkin of Nurgle"><selections><selection id="rx16rq7" name="Belga the Cystwitch" entryId="e333-6c9a-6529-f39d::ac24-667b-4672-4e78" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c6f6-fd80-0b88-1517" name="Ruptured Cysts" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a visible **^^Diseased^^** enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target. Then, inflict 1 mortal damage on each other **^^Diseased^^** enemy unit within 3&quot; of the target. If the chanting roll is 9+, you can also pick a friendly **Plaguebearers** unit within 12&quot; of the target. For each enemy **^^Infantry^^** model slain by this ability this turn, you can return 1 slain model to that friendly unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d">**^^Prayer^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile><profile id="99db-5bca-e01d-8a89" name="Belga the Cystwitch" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">3</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="294b-89a4-c70d-57b3" name="Scry the Filth" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick 1 of the following effects to apply for the rest of the turn:
• Add 1 to casting rolls for friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Wizards^^** while they are within 3&quot; of this unit.
• Add 1 to chanting rolls for friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Priests^^** while they are within 3&quot; of this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="rxbcwrk" name="Belga the Cystwitch" entryId="e333-6c9a-6529-f39d::3dca-edd0-82e1-9fbb" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="rzt4f6i" name="Thrice-tainted Staff" entryId="e333-6c9a-6529-f39d::b4e2-336f-351e-eea5" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="9dc0-aed3-6263-0a96" name="Thrice-tainted Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="3fe-84f4-cec6-a1c1" name="PRIEST (1)" entryId="3fe-84f4-cec6-a1c1" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="s5kr82c" name="Bloab Rotspawned" entryId="42e4-cc7-e1ba-f794::5d0c-177b-8fbf-c3ee" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="af6d-d533-ed12-742d" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Bilespurter's Claws** is 3.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="d0b6-b6c1-df15-868" name="Bloab Rotspawned" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="576f-cfd2-8ae-b640" name="Daemon Flies" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Monster^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, subtract 1 from the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="45ba-81f7-14fe-8623" name="Miasma of Pestilence" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible friendly unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Until the start of your next turn, other than the **Companion** ability, weapon abilities for attacks that target that friendly unit have no effect.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="s6o3uug" name="Bloab Rotspawned" entryId="42e4-cc7-e1ba-f794::f40a-e06c-77b3-5f92" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="s7zgqww" name="Bilespurter's Claws and Maw" entryId="42e4-cc7-e1ba-f794::58f8-8536-a905-a9ca" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f184-dc22-ce28-dc09" name="Bilespurter's Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="s76a6o" name="Bilespurter's Vile Bile" entryId="42e4-cc7-e1ba-f794::9e74-8d99-52d9-e35f" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a90-cf8a-e5cf-5ddb" name="Bilespurter's Vile Bile" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">7&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Shoot in Combat, Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="s795qel" name="Harvestman's Scythe" entryId="42e4-cc7-e1ba-f794::1389-a6b4-44f3-8a19" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="423c-e99f-beb4-16b3" name="Harvestman's Scythe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-**^^Monster^^** (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="260" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="sf48o9" name="Cankerborn" entryId="7264-7864-6344-c4e2::d82c-ba5b-b703-0ab7" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="4bbe-7272-507e-4a71" name="Cankerborn" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="3cd1-743b-840f-e3a7" name="Utter Defilement" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">This unit's **Pestilent Pollutants** are tokens. This unit has 2 **Pestilent Pollutants**. Pick an objective or terrain feature within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Place 2 of this unit's **Pestilent Pollutants** next to the target. If both of this unit's **Pestilent Pollutants** are already on the battlefield, pick 1 of them, remove it from the battlefield and place it next to the target instead.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="db42-b099-38fd-0d85" name="From the Tainted Earth" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove this unit from the battlefield and set it up again more than 9&quot; from all enemy units and wholly within 3&quot; of:
• An objective or terrain feature that has a friendly **Pestilent Pollutant**, or
• A **^^Polluted^^** terrain feature (see Gelgus Pust's 'Master Contaminator' ability), or
• An objective you control</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Core^^**, **^^Move^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Grey</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3b04-d902-db70-f233" name="Entropy Endures" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this unit has 2 models and would be automatically destroyed, it is not automatically destroyed. Instead, 1 model in this unit is slain.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="sh994vp" name="Cankerborn" entryId="7264-7864-6344-c4e2::4f14-0682-fd86-bd91" number="2" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="sha6koh" name="Blightblades" entryId="7264-7864-6344-c4e2::e5c9-4645-b26a-4d6d" number="2" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f3e4-5622-bc2f-7db8" name="Blightblades" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="180" /></costs><categories><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /></categories></selection><selection id="oe0j64k" name="Doktor Festus" entryId="6876-a297-6e4c-6857::65b1-8753-01c7-2fa9" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2b1d-b11f-eac9-f9c8" name="Doktor Festus" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="cef9-0a4b-a83b-91a5" name="Scumboil Pox" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^** within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Subtract 1 from the target's power level, to a minimum of 0, until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="e5e0-93d6-f07f-8c0f" name="Delightful Brews, Splendid Restoratives" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible unit within this unit's combat range to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If the target is a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit, **Heal (D3)** the target. If the target is an enemy unit, roll a dice. On a 3+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ofxgpcr" name="Doktor Festus" entryId="6876-a297-6e4c-6857::ad03-b0ed-ce4f-655d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="og30tfa" name="Plague Staff" entryId="6876-a297-6e4c-6857::c18c-1dab-42a5-8f6b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="e5d8-603b-e5bb-f6dd" name="Plague Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="100" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="otu95x" name="Epidemius, Tallyman of Nurgle" entryId="531a-84bb-ea1c-428a::5b0d-37e4-73a4-f952" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5a61-648b-d397-c2e9" name="Epidemius, Tallyman of Nurgle" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="9a80-8b56-bd00-239a" name="Tallyman of Nurgle" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You gain a number of **tally points** equal to the current battle round number.
During the battle round, you can spend your **tally points**. For each **tally point** you spend, you can re-roll 1 hit roll, 1 wound roll, 1 save roll or 1 ward roll for a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.
At the end of the battle round, any unspent **tally points** are lost.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="ou7wklao" name="Epidemius, Tallyman of Nurgle" entryId="531a-84bb-ea1c-428a::0677-2831-7864-e47d" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ov2bj5h" name="Epidemius's Balesword" entryId="531a-84bb-ea1c-428a::889b-15f0-5d5a-c8fc" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="fe0d-98fe-dd39-27a6" name="Epidemius's Balesword" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="ovy04um" name="Mound of Nurglings" entryId="531a-84bb-ea1c-428a::a797-99e3-ea98-107c" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="739c-c189-e281-8877" name="Mound of Nurglings" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">10</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="130" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" name="Legends" entryId="acaf-8bb6-d6f-3e2a" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="spj7npp" name="Festus the Leechlord" entryId="28c1-06d8-1cc2-b6ef::3226-6035-594a-b682" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="dfcb-be8b-6baf-8d54" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Gathoblyt's Fanged Maw** is 3.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="d15e-3c73-be84-66c7" name="Festus the Leechlord" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">5&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="70b2-9f11-c002-3a95" name="Vile Poisons and Debilitating Toxins" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit did not charge this turn, pick an enemy unit in combat with it to be the target. You cannot pick a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">You and your opponent must roll off. Add this unit's Control characteristic to your roll and the target's Control characteristic to your opponent's roll. If your roll is higher, apply the corresponding effect:
• If the target is a **^^Hero^^** or **^^Monster^^**, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the difference between your roll and your opponent's roll.
• If the target is a non-**^^Hero^^** non-**^^Monster^^** unit, 1 model in the target unit is slain.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="d9a3-fed2-4082-1def" name="Annelid Engorgement" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">For each enemy unit that was in combat with this unit this turn and was destroyed this turn, this unit gains D3 **leech points** for the rest of the battle. Until the end of the next turn, add 1 to this unit's Control characteristic for each leech point it currently has.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8249-26ab-f1d2-4fac" name="The Leechlord's Curse" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">This unit gains 1 **leech point** for the rest of the battle. Until the start of your next turn, each time the target uses a **^^Core^^** ability or command, after that ability has been resolved, roll a dice. On a 3+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target. Then, if any damage points were allocated to the target by this ability, **Heal (1)** this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="sql3qq" name="Festus the Leechlord" entryId="28c1-06d8-1cc2-b6ef::8e18-4f65-476a-8181" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="srzndap" name="Gathoblyt's Fanged Maw" entryId="28c1-06d8-1cc2-b6ef::1004-8b6b-e205-aafd" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="670a-3acd-ab44-5584" name="Gathoblyt's Fanged Maw" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal), Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="srg6o5w" name="Gnarled Plague Staff" entryId="28c1-06d8-1cc2-b6ef::aedd-99d7-4870-9c29" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f058-3552-d0c2-2810" name="Gnarled Plague Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Auto-wound)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="290" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="t6qmj6" name="Gelgus Pust, the Prince of Sores" entryId="b321-d8fd-8273-31df::5fef-f075-9e25-ee6a" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2c64-0b69-a998-05b4" name="Grin of the Grandfather" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick each enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice for each target. If the roll equals or exceeds the target's Control characteristic, pick 1 of the following to apply for the rest of the turn:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's combat attacks.
• Subtract 1 from wound rolls for the target's combat attacks.
• Subtract 1 from the target's Control characteristic.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="bf30-faeb-e19a-6785" name="Gelgus Pust, the Prince of Sores" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="384f-9982-27fa-b17b" name="Parasitic Infestation" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick each enemy unit that charged this turn and is in combat with this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="4fb3-d88c-6100-61ae" name="Polluting Aura" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit is wholly within 6&quot; of a **^^Polluted^^** terrain feature, each time that unit uses or is the target of an ability that would heal 1 or more damage points, add 1 to the number of damage points healed.
While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of a **^^Polluted^^** terrain feature, each time that unit uses or is the target of an ability that would heal 1 or more damage points, subtract 1 from the number of damage points healed, to a minimum of 0.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="4371-1994-3a10-553a" name="Master Contaminator" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Battle, Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a terrain feature within 6&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The target has the **^^Polluted^^** keyword for the rest of the battle.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="t6zimvw" name="Gelgus Pust, the Prince of Sores" entryId="b321-d8fd-8273-31df::ab96-174d-6d88-6ca9" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="t78qkhbp" name="Malady and Contagion" entryId="b321-d8fd-8273-31df::b4ae-172f-e5c3-ccac" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="eee7-a9f5-3b51-3f6e" name="Malady and Contagion" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Auto-wound)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="200" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="td6fesm" name="Great Unclean One" entryId="4a18-bdb4-644e-3ab4::bbb9-4b05-be8a-af89" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="78a-1c63-a8cd-d4fb" name="Great Unclean One" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">20</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="2727-f062-ca67-6594" name="Bloated With Corruption" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit is damaged, pick up to 3 enemy units in combat with this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="31ee-f67c-6506-dadc" name="Plague Wind" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target. You cannot pick a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature. Then, make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">The target has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="384-bcf1-cb38-aae0" name="Locus of Nurgle" hidden="false" typeId="55ac-f837-dded-5872" typeName="Ability (Command)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="736-6e3a-d0b5-a1b0">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Cost" typeId="a49e-3082-e2a6-e802">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="b77f-7548-840e-c086">Pick a friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Daemon^^** unit that started the battle with 3 or more models and that has been destroyed to be the target</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="2111-3ca8-61dd-a5f0">Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 6&quot; of this unit or a friendly **Feculent Gnarlmaw** and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="445d-f443-5448-e7ce"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5c69-e4b9-19bc-e801">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="2bd5-08f1-f3d1-86f7">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="df75-e7dc-12b5-48a8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="a99f-1b24-64b9-afed" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Colossal Blight Weapons** is 3.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="teod54" name="Great Unclean One" entryId="4a18-bdb4-644e-3ab4::ae51-81d-58ac-7259" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="thcdf6s" name="Colossal Blight Weapons" entryId="4a18-bdb4-644e-3ab4::cf87-574a-867a-a056" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="670e-4512-b1c8-4f33" name="Colossal Blight Weapons" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="thuylz" name="Noxious Bile" entryId="4a18-bdb4-644e-3ab4::641a-a008-7b06-9ca6" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5cb1-32e8-371d-e52" name="Noxious Bile" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">7&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">D3+3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Shoot in Combat</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="380" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="tpwxcl" name="Gutrot Spume" entryId="3ed8-5faa-c6e5-24d::5586-2cfb-7451-aedc" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8955-6418-d988-393e" name="Pestilential Beachhead" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit if it is **aboard the Slime Fleet**.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Set up this unit on the battlefield, wholly within 7&quot; of a battlefield edge and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units. Then set up every other friendly unit that is **aboard the Slime Fleet** on the battlefield wholly within 7&quot; of a battlefield edge, wholly within 7&quot; of this unit and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="568e-e879-14d9-d74a" name="Gutrot Spume" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d444-e602-8844-3c65" name="Flailing Tentacles" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Infantry Hero^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="6b80-bb6a-952a-be16" name="Master of the Slime Fleet" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Deployment Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a regiment led by this unit to be the target if no units from that regiment have been deployed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Each unit in the target regiment is set up in reserve **aboard the Slime Fleet**. Those units have now been deployed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Deploy^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="tpqv9j" name="Gutrot Spume" entryId="3ed8-5faa-c6e5-24d::f5e2-2b72-f4bb-a7a4" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="tr7l7xpg" name="Rot-pocked Axe" entryId="3ed8-5faa-c6e5-24d::7a03-cc75-a40a-f458" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8d6d-4eec-4c1a-8145" name="Rot-pocked Axe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-Hero (+1 Rend), Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="100" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="txslug" name="Harbinger of Decay" entryId="3f0c-9c21-d5a7-b913::c473-7f30-9a81-12d4" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="8ef7-80c7-17a3-251d" name="Harbinger of Decay" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="58c7-6283-dae7-7900" name="Knell of Doom" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Enemy Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3. If the target is within 6&quot; of a friendly **Sloven Knights** unit, you can roll a D6 instead. If the roll equals or exceeds the target's Control characteristic, subtract 1 from wound rolls for the target's attacks until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="2b77-4fcc-c836-b" name="Omens of Decay" hidden="false" typeId="5946-234-d7b4-6195" typeName="Ability (Prayer)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="76bf-8126-64d4-c709">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Chanting Value" typeId="f192-6780-8138-9cef">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="284c-90b2-245b-adf3">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a chanting roll of D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="6219-6fcc-5ae2-a6b7">Subtract twice the current battle round number from the target's control score for the rest of the turn. If the chanting roll was 10+, this ability affects all enemy units within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="e3d8-f58b-e4e0-8e9d"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="7564-4bf0-b34a-b143">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="c63c-196d-34a7-cec3">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="5d25-63d6-3935-9312" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="txysuiq" name="Harbinger of Decay" entryId="3f0c-9c21-d5a7-b913::e283-dac2-a856-4589" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="u195sme" name="Daemonic Mount's Flyblown Bite" entryId="3f0c-9c21-d5a7-b913::e1cf-ab58-e94-f78" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="fde9-5d8d-a886-c92a" name="Daemonic Mount's Flyblown Bite" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="u1d04f" name="Grim Rotsword or Plague Scythe" entryId="3f0c-9c21-d5a7-b913::37a5-d463-da1f-2a94" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="6cca-f7d7-47d0-d1d5" name="Grim Rotsword or Plague Scythe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="3fe-84f4-cec6-a1c1" name="PRIEST (1)" entryId="3fe-84f4-cec6-a1c1" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="u9gh3ej" name="Horticulous Slimux" entryId="6905-ccf8-6433-cf49::6393-ad97-81d9-ccbe" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f3ca-68cb-8c37-825b" name="Cultivating the Garden of Nurgle" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If there is no more than 1 friendly **Feculent Gnarlmaw** on the battlefield, you can set up a **Feculent Gnarlmaw** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and more than 3&quot; from all enemy units, objectives and other terrain features.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="b09-2052-b59c-3237" name="Horticulous Slimux" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b226-8a5b-e21b-6393" name="Beast Handler" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Movement Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Beast of Nurgle** unit that has been destroyed.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, set up a replacement unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and more than 9&quot; from all enemy units.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Rallying</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="2a32-11d3-c7bd-5b40" name="Gnarlmaw Whisperer" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Your Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Feculent Gnarlmaw** to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Remove the target from the battlefield and set it up again wholly within 12&quot; of this unit and more than 3&quot; from all enemy units, objectives, and other terrain features.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="u9d0ppe" name="Horticulous Slimux" entryId="6905-ccf8-6433-cf49::7839-1e95-ed94-fe19" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ua5ifs4" name="Lopping Shears" entryId="6905-ccf8-6433-cf49::e86b-b929-20c7-8490" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="996f-afd1-66de-fbd8" name="Lopping Shears" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="uatpup" name="Slime-encrusted Jaws" entryId="6905-ccf8-6433-cf49::cb1e-9651-90d4-40bd" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="61cc-d84c-824f-7afc" name="Slime-encrusted Jaws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="ui3kbq8" name="Lord of Afflictions" entryId="ec63-72b8-14c2-2043::3da0-ddfc-c8f-5e80" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="85c1-6d8d-32e7-1266" name="Lord of Afflictions" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="b742-948a-9f11-4c59" name="Master of Rot Flies" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this turn, pick this unit and up to 2 friendly **Pusgoyle Blightlords** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of the targets' **Rot Fly's Mouthparts and Sting** melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="7e00-9e75-6cd4-b189" name="Vectors of Foulest Contagion" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up to 3 enemy units in combat with this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a D3 for each target. On a 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="8e01-c601-8a44-8f74" name="Fly" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">As this unit moves, it ignores other models, terrain features and the combat ranges of enemy units. It cannot end its move in combat unless specified in the ability that allowed it to move. Ignore any vertical distance moved for this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Gray</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="uj7t2sr" name="Lord of Afflictions" entryId="ec63-72b8-14c2-2043::e70b-293d-979b-b0ed" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="utn9fme" name="Festerspike" entryId="ec63-72b8-14c2-2043::f4e7-5be-2f59-917c" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="afa9-b578-5d8b-88ee" name="Festerspike" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Charge (+1 Damage)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="utqmr3c" name="Rot Fly's Mouthparts and Sting" entryId="ec63-72b8-14c2-2043::f1d1-ef8f-676f-3f8b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c9fc-bb4f-c215-36f8" name="Rot Fly's Mouthparts and Sting" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="170" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" name="CAVALRY" entryId="926c-df8c-6841-d49e" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" name="FLY" entryId="b979-4c3e-7d0e-6921" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="v2kut5k" name="Lord of Blights" entryId="a23c-441a-909a-b154::b0b6-7b56-5e4-a46" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ec35-fc1e-1973-c9f2" name="Lord of Blights" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="62e8-d90f-82bb-4f1e" name="Thrice-ripened Death's Heads" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit that charged this turn and is in combat with this unit or with a friendly **Plague Drones** wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll D3. On 2+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="cd47-668b-9fe5-10e4" name="Festering Bulwark" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick this unit and a friendly **Putrid Blightkings** unit within 3&quot; of this unit to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, ignore negative modifiers to save rolls for the targets for the rest of the turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="v2dgz1j" name="Lord of Blights" entryId="a23c-441a-909a-b154::5c7a-6e61-42b6-3db0" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="v60bk9g" name="Bubotic Hammer" entryId="a23c-441a-909a-b154::fc22-73bf-ba19-53a9" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="bad-ec1f-c1f1-daa9" name="Bubotic Hammer" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Anti-charge (+1 Rend)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="140" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="vexmvpd" name="Lord of Plagues" entryId="549f-8a55-57c4-4785::542a-9c27-908f-8c30" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="25ce-e99b-7118-1971" name="Lord of Plagues" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="8d36-892d-9940-32ea" name="Sevenfold Slaughter" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Rotswords** unit that did not charge this turn and is wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 2+, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's **Ruined Master-crafted Weapons** for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="62bc-578a-c14f-7d60" name="Lord of the Infected Legions" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to wound rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **Rotswords** units that did not charge this turn while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="vfp9idf" name="Lord of Plagues" entryId="549f-8a55-57c4-4785::3398-ea0d-f6e8-ec77" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="vjjhly" name="Plague-ridden Great Blade" entryId="549f-8a55-57c4-4785::bb6c-2ad9-d081-12d3" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ac26-c454-78a6-783a" name="Plague-ridden Great Blade" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="120" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="vsbbomn" name="Morbidex Twiceborn" entryId="b9f2-c7b5-bb7b-98f2::4de5-75a7-bc3d-8ced" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7595-2783-c489-4ea3" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Tripletongue's Claws** is 3.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="680a-b312-f3f1-995a" name="Morbidex Twiceborn" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="975-e260-594c-cd0c" name="Gigantic Nurgling-kin" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">**Heal (X) this unit**, where X is half the number of damage points this unit has (rounding up).</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="d621-1c2a-97a3-270e" name="Tide of Nurglings" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick up tp 2 friendly **Nurglings** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit's to be the targets.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice for each target. On a 2+:
• If the target is not in combat, it can move a number of inches equal to the roll but cannot end that move in combat.
• If the target is in combat, it can make a pile-in move.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="a9b6-ff51-8ca0-cb78" name="Lord of Nurglings" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While any friendly **Nurglings** units are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit:
• Ignore the first damage point that would be allocated to that **Nurglings* unit each phase.
• That **Nurglings** unit can ignore the effect of the 'Beast' ability.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="vtunofb" name="Morbidex Twiceborn" entryId="b9f2-c7b5-bb7b-98f2::586e-ae3f-7908-9d6b" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="vut8v4" name="Fleshreaper Scythe" entryId="b9f2-c7b5-bb7b-98f2::d82d-24a0-c18f-d6c1" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f526-14e5-428c-e2c9" name="Fleshreaper Scythe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="vuoyj15" name="Tripletongue's Claws" entryId="b9f2-c7b5-bb7b-98f2::939-a628-e00-f11c" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="6233-c2a6-405c-29ea" name="Tripletongue's Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="vuykmx9" name="Tripletongue's Slabrous Tongues" entryId="b9f2-c7b5-bb7b-98f2::873c-a30e-d3c7-a89c" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5226-8129-e2d8-6b93" name="Tripletongue's Slabrous Tongues" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">7&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Shoot in Combat, Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="250" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="w2x86x" name="Orghotts Daemonspew" entryId="79ac-11a4-9f0d-34c5::b30a-a7ad-baf5-52a9" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5a68-280b-b2a5-53aa" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Whippermaw's Claws** is 3.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="7134-a4cf-77eb-6591" name="Orghotts Daemonspew" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">8&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">14</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">5</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f8bb-9c41-b993-d982" name="Grasping Tongue" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to wound rolls for combat attacks made by friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** units that target that enemy unit for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="5cee-b370-b704-f43a" name="Acid Ichor" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Each time you make an unmodified save roll of 6 for a combat attack that targets this unit, inflict 1 mortal damage on the attacking unit after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Green</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="w2ih7jr" name="Orghotts Daemonspew" entryId="79ac-11a4-9f0d-34c5::f0a6-d0d7-3ef8-3099" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="w4hpjwg" name="The Rotaxes" entryId="79ac-11a4-9f0d-34c5::8d82-ca9-3658-4f5b" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7f60-ffb2-bd8-8883" name="The Rotaxes" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="w45urr" name="Whippermaw's Claws" entryId="79ac-11a4-9f0d-34c5::c8e0-cfa7-acb9-5772" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="d4e4-fab7-163f-fa38" name="Whippermaw's Claws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="w4t1hs" name="Whippermaw's Grasping Tongue" entryId="79ac-11a4-9f0d-34c5::c657-89cd-d3f8-1ee9" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="fbcb-776b-90d7-430" name="Whippermaw's Grasping Tongue" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">7&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">D6</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Shoot in Combat, Companion</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="260" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="wc31rs" name="Poxbringer, Herald of Nurgle" entryId="2445-ff39-e129-a7dc::3f9b-a5f1-3290-cd8a" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="a43c-e9c1-1690-1d15" name="Poxbringer, Herald of Nurgle" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d07b-383b-994f-4c33" name="Captain of the Plague Legions" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Reaction: You declared a **^^Fight^^** ability for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick a friendly **Plaguebearers** unit that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="wdlpqb" name="Poxbringer, Herald of Nurgle" entryId="2445-ff39-e129-a7dc::6279-7e3d-25a4-f212" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="whgfhqr" name="Corrupted Balesword" entryId="2445-ff39-e129-a7dc::a490-1dd0-e5f-154e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="ed3e-4b2c-7395-415d" name="Corrupted Balesword" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="90" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="wqtodud" name="Rotbringer Sorcerer" entryId="2184-b254-8bf9-c04d::8fe7-5f8f-68ac-b786" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f4e5-7991-55b-924f" name="Rotbringer Sorcerer" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e612-7179-aa36-739f" name="Tainted Sorceries" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy unit that was picked to be the target of a spell that was successfully cast by this unit this phase to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 2+, subtract 1 from ward rolls for the target for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="wrtdlz8" name="Rotbringer Sorcerer" entryId="2184-b254-8bf9-c04d::36b6-320c-7e7c-16db" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="wvfnajh" name="Rotwood Staff" entryId="2184-b254-8bf9-c04d::c09-bbe3-5db6-6856" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cc0f-830-9933-52b5" name="Rotwood Staff" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="100" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="x414b6x" name="Rotigus" entryId="6011-228f-fea3-caa5::bb0e-3648-ee6e-3e43" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="66e4-b8e8-2237-bd41" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of its **Gnarlrod** is 3.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="95f9-4690-c034-5817" name="Rotigus" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">22</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">10</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="2507-a15e-756a-428d" name="Mountain of Loathsome Flesh" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Charge Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">If this unit charged this turn, roll a dice. On a 3+, pick an enemy unit within 1&quot; of it to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a number of dice equal to the number of models in the target unit. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c4ca-1f85-2f0a-d219" name="Bringer of Plenty" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Add 1 to casting rolls for friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** units while they are wholly within 12&quot; of this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="dc53-3961-b211-d302" name="Deluge of Nurgle" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">8</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick each enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the enemy targets, then pick each friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the friendly targets. Then, make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Inflict 1 mortal damage on each enemy target and **Heal (1)** each friendly target. Then, until the start of your next turn, if an ability would heal or return any slain models to an enemy unit while they are within 18&quot; of this unit, that ability does not heal any damage points or return any slain models to it.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Special</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="x5mggh" name="Rotigus" entryId="6011-228f-fea3-caa5::16f6-a6e9-b74a-eff1" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="x7te4ku" name="Fanged Maws" entryId="6011-228f-fea3-caa5::32ff-2eda-f4ad-c64d" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="368c-3019-9d61-e99d" name="Fanged Maws" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="x7xrifr" name="Gnarlrod" entryId="6011-228f-fea3-caa5::e530-b232-13b4-c203" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="c31-67fd-5317-360a" name="Gnarlrod" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="420" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" name="WIZARD (2)" entryId="8179-697a-9f4c-91d4" primary="false" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="p6nwafq" name="Shaman Foulhoof" entryId="5c96-b078-14ad-0cca::e676-1e6d-0d6e-f9de" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="fe0a-8192-be57-e0ee" name="Purulent Profusion" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">7</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 18&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Subtract 1 from the Rend characteristic of the target's melee weapons until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Defensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="b22b-8df3-3d27-58fe" name="Shaman Foulhoof" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="77f1-6c99-a2f6-8d9f" name="Rampant Defilement" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Pestigors** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 3+, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="pa6qtdl" name="Shaman Foulhoof" entryId="5c96-b078-14ad-0cca::52da-4bc9-e9f8-26ea" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="pbdroqm" name="Rotstave" entryId="5c96-b078-14ad-0cca::d8ac-9d22-9651-dcce" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="20a0-04e2-6253-e13d" name="Rotstave" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">D3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="110" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="plvkj8g" name="Sloppity Bilepiper, Herald of Nurgle" entryId="907f-d7f2-6e21-7bf3::29d8-9408-2148-b2c9" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="563a-95ee-1e25-ed8d" name="Sloppity Bilepiper, Herald of Nurgle" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="d45a-f55b-6b34-4733" name="Jolly Gutpipes" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a visible friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle Daemon^^** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit or a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">If you picked a friendly unit to be the target, roll a dice. If the roll equals or exceeds the target's Control characteristic, add 2 to run rolls and charge rolls for the target until the start of your next turn.
If you picked an enemy unit to be the target, roll a dice. If the roll equals or exceeds the target's Control characteristic, until the start of your next turn, while this unit is on the battlefield, inflict D3 mortal damage on the target:
• Each time the target ends a move further from this unit than it was at the start of the move, after the ability used by the target has been resolved.
• Each time the target is removed from the battlefield and set up again on the battlefield further from the unit than it was before it was removed, after the ability used by the target has been resolved.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Offensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="pm5tt9" name="Sloppity Bilepiper, Herald of Nurgle" entryId="907f-d7f2-6e21-7bf3::cb9b-3778-6186-a015" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="ptcfq5" name="Marotter" entryId="907f-d7f2-6e21-7bf3::54c-2047-c407-a72f" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="f292-cf54-ee87-10b0" name="Marotter" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="90" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="q4d56c" name="Spoilpox Scrivener, Herald of Nurgle" entryId="9997-1816-3e4e-ae45::d44-acf2-9394-f93" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="26b1-7b9f-f973-6bf4" name="Spoilpox Scrivener, Herald of Nurgle" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">5+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="ba07-4997-d508-1bdb" name="Keep Counting, I'm Watching You" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick a friendly **Plaguebearers** unit wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 2+, pick 1 of the following effects to apply until the start of your next turn:
***Tally of Blows:*** Add 1 to wound rolls for the target's combat attacks.
***Recorded Stamina:*** Add 5 to the target's control score.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="c1c4-0a94-911b-c32a" name="Stupefying Sneezes" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Any Shooting Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Monster^^** that had any damage points allocated to it this phase by this unit's shooting attacks to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The target cannot use **^^Rampage^^** abilities until the start of your next turn.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Blue</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="3bc-444a-5cf8-e4d" name="Guarded Hero" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">If this **^^Hero^^** is within the combat range of a friendly unit that is not a **^^Hero^^**:
• Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target this Hero.
• If this **^^Hero^^** is **^^Infantry^^**, they cannot be picked as the target of shooting attacks made by models more than 12&quot; from them.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="q5wz77b" name="Spoilpox Scrivener, Herald of Nurgle" entryId="9997-1816-3e4e-ae45::cd4a-ac2e-8003-dfde" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="qbprk38" name="Disgusting Sneezes" entryId="9997-1816-3e4e-ae45::cf67-8794-76aa-6433" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="7f1c-98ba-8901-7d2d" name="Disgusting Sneezes" hidden="false" typeId="1fd-a42f-41d3-fe05" typeName="Ranged Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Rng" typeId="c6b5-908c-a604-1a98">7&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="aa17-4296-2887-e05d">D6</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="194d-aeb6-5ba7-83b4">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="d3d5-9dc6-13de-8d1">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="d03f-a9ae-3eec-755">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="96c2-d0a5-ea1e-653b">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="d793-3dd7-9c13-741e">Shoot in Combat</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="qbtuu0k" name="Distended Maw" entryId="9997-1816-3e4e-ae45::6863-b7df-56d0-9e7a" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="2e0f-127f-d270-9811" name="Distended Maw" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="80" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" name="WARD (5+)" entryId="52cc-95fd-6cd3-8f72" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" name="DAEMON" entryId="dc0b-e417-51f4-10f0" primary="false" /><category id="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" name="INFANTRY" entryId="75d6-6995-dfcc-3898" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="qn4j8om" name="The Glottkin" entryId="7ac6-4e61-f8a6-86ad::d561-75fb-fd5f-57a5" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="9826-92d8-2722-c66b" name="Battle Damaged" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit has 10 or more damage points, the Attacks characteristic of **Ghurk's Tentacle** is 3.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Damage</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="89ae-5ae8-3f5c-781f" name="The Glottkin" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">6&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">24</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">10</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e66d-9096-37f6-2599" name="Blighted Stampede" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Once Per Turn (Army), Reaction: You declared the 'Counter-charge' command for this unit</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Pick up to 2 friendly **^^Maggotkin of Nurgle^^** units wholly within 12&quot; of this unit to be the targets. After the 'Counter-charge' command for this unit has been resolved, if this unit charged, each of the targets can immediately use the 'Counter-charge' command in an order of your choosing without any command points being spent.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f">**^^Rampage^^**</characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Orange</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Movement</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="a1af-e424-4974-43e1" name="Overgrowth of Flesh" hidden="false" typeId="7312-8367-c171-f2ef" typeName="Ability (Spell)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="de6f-d57b-248a-83be">Your Hero Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Casting Value" typeId="9fc7-b0f6-d018-a608">6</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="24f8-3803-4ab1-3b6c">Pick a visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of this unit to be the target, then make a casting roll of 2D6.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1cb9-a-1345-907f">Roll a number of dice equal to the target's Health characteristic. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target, to a maximum of 7 mortal damage. If any mortal damage was inflicted on the target, and the target was not a **^^Manifestation^^** or terrain feature, it has the **^^Diseased^^** keyword.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="353f-565e-c351-1cf2">**^^Spell^^**</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="16b6-0911-f549-a4bd">Yellow</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="da27-8d61-f955-5031">Offensive</attribute></attributes></profile><profile id="440a-2060-8677-10d8" name="Horrific Opponent" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">Subtract 5 from the control scores of enemy units while they are in combat with this unit.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="423e-40ae-d550-e8ed" name="Tentacle Trap" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">Any Combat Phase</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an enemy **^^Hero^^** or **^^Monster^^** in combat with this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">Roll a dice. On a 4+, for the rest of the turn:
• The target cannot move and cannot be removed from the battlefield by an ability that would allow it to be set up elsewhere on the battlefield. 
• Add 1 to hit rolls for combat attacks that target that enemy unit.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Red</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="qouqszo" name="The Glottkin" entryId="7ac6-4e61-f8a6-86ad::c01a-e8e8-275b-dffc" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="qpwiteo" name="Ghurk's Lamprey Maw" entryId="7ac6-4e61-f8a6-86ad::798a-c33a-a32-5ad2" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="229c-c358-e893-4119" name="Ghurk's Lamprey Maw" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="qp6z3o" name="Ghurk's Tentacle" entryId="7ac6-4e61-f8a6-86ad::66bc-62f-2ffe-1da" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="576d-9108-da23-ff54" name="Ghurk's Tentacle" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">2+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">5</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="qpb8r" name="Otto's Scythe" entryId="7ac6-4e61-f8a6-86ad::9dd9-6cfa-1a95-166e" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="cf4d-3fc7-acc4-61bd" name="Otto's Scythe" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">4</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">-</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection></selections></selection></selections><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="470" /></costs><categories><category id="6e72-1656-d554-528a" entryId="6e72-1656-d554-528a" name="HERO" primary="true" /><category id="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" name="UNIQUE" entryId="72ce-2188-70bf-2dbd" primary="false" /><category id="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" name="WARMASTER" entryId="c203-51a0-3d44-6b07" primary="false" /><category id="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" name="CHAOS" entryId="319b-38ee-d10d-e800" primary="false" /><category id="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" name="MAGGOTKIN OF NURGLE" entryId="ca3c-6c3b-4887-3a9d" primary="false" /><category id="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" name="MONSTER" entryId="6d54-625c-d063-13e2" primary="false" /><category id="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" name="ROTBRINGERS" entryId="b665-bb9e-c89c-ad7d" primary="false" /><category id="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" name="WIZARD (1)" entryId="6f28-c3f6-4b1b-8aff" primary="false" /><category id="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" name="WARD (6+)" entryId="70a4-383f-421f-52cd" primary="false" /></categories></selection><selection id="rbdztrv" name="Grandfather's Gardeners" entryId="3ca9-bad9-ca9f-0b91::c031-2a32-ee55-4a1c" number="1" type="unit" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="03ae-85d4-990c-7a26" name="Grandfather's Gardeners" hidden="false" typeId="ff03-376e-972f-8ab2" typeName="Unit" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Move" typeId="fed0-d1b3-1bb8-c501">4&quot;</characteristic><characteristic name="Health" typeId="96be-54ae-ce7b-10b7">3</characteristic><characteristic name="Save" typeId="1981-ef09-96f6-7aa9">6+</characteristic><characteristic name="Control" typeId="6c6f-8510-9ce1-fc6e">1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="24c4-8d2a-e0b6-7005" name="Seeds of Rot" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">When using the 'Blessed by the Plaguefather' ability, if you choose to infect an enemy unit, you can pick an enemy unit that is contesting an objective that is **seeded with rot**.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile><profile id="87c7-c25c-9d9f-13bb" name="Blooming Plague" hidden="false" typeId="59b6-d47a-a68a-5dcc" typeName="Ability (Activated)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Timing" typeId="652c-3d84-4e7-14f4">End of Any Turn</characteristic><characteristic name="Declare" typeId="bad3-f9c5-ba46-18cb">Pick an objective that is contested by this unit to be the target.</characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="b6f1-ba36-6cd-3b03">The target is **seeded with rot** for the rest of the battle.</characteristic><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="12e8-3214-7d8f-1d0f"></characteristic><characteristic name="Used By" typeId="1b32-c9d6-3106-166b"></characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="5a11-eab3-180c-ddf5">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="6d16-c86b-2698-85a4">Special</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="2d74-4dcd-8468-87fa" /></attributes></profile><profile id="ed70-f30-2f5a-747f" name="Ward Save" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">In step 1 of the damage sequence (see 18.0), make a **ward roll** of D6 for each **damage point** in this unit's **damage pool**. If the roll equals or exceeds this unit's **ward value**, remove that damage point from the damage pool.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Black</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Defensive</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><selections><selection id="rdv2zl" name="Bug-Eyed Dripterus" entryId="3ca9-bad9-ca9f-0b91::a84c-33a5-dcf8-501f" number="1" type="model" from="entry"><selections><selection id="reyzebc" name="Gardening Tools" entryId="3ca9-bad9-ca9f-0b91::a42c-fa7f-9d3d-28f4" number="1" type="upgrade" from="entry"><profiles><profile id="5f40-998e-0932-2906" name="Gardening Tools" hidden="false" typeId="9074-76b6-9e2f-81e3" typeName="Melee Weapon" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Atk" typeId="60e-35aa-31ed-e488">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Hit" typeId="26dc-168-b2fd-cb93">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Wnd" typeId="61c1-22cc-40af-2847">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Rnd" typeId="eccc-10fa-6958-fb73">-</characteristic><characteristic name="Dmg" typeId="e948-9c71-12a6-6be4">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Ability" typeId="eda3-7332-5db1-4159">Crit (Mortal)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles></selection><selection id="rf7v4nf" name="Standard Bearer" entryId="3ca9-bad9-ca9f-0b91::d5aa-250d-bb2e-fd39::7f34-77c9-597-62c3" entryGroupId="3ca9-bad9-ca9f-0b91::b662-5f4f-67e4-42d9" number="1" type="upgrade" from="group" group="Command Models"><profiles><profile id="1ec9-5b34-74df-6e40" name="Standard Bearer" hidden="false" typeId="907f-a48-6a04-f788" typeName="Ability (Passive)" from="entry"><characteristics><characteristic name="Keywords" typeId="b977-7c5e-33b2-428e"></characteristic><characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">While this unit contains any standard bearers, add 1 to this unit's control score.</characteristic></characteristics><attributes><attribute name="Color" typeId="50fe-4f29-6bc3-dcc6">Purple</attribute><attribute name="Type" typeId="bf11-4e10-3ab1-06f4">Control</attribute><attribute name="Parent Node" typeId="e2e1-15ca-d345-22b8" /></attributes></profile></profiles><categories><category id="9c77-5e0b-a20f-d885" name="Command Model" entryId="9c77